       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SIZEERRORDEMO.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 SMALL-TOTAL PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
       01 AMOUNT-1 PIC 9(3) VALUE 500.
       01 AMOUNT-2 PIC 9(3) VALUE 700.
       01 AVERAGE-VAL PIC 9(3)V99.
       01 DIVISOR PIC 9(1) VALUE 3.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           ADD AMOUNT-1 AMOUNT-2 TO SMALL-TOTAL
               ON SIZE ERROR
                   DISPLAY "OVERFLOW: SUM EXCEEDS PIC 9(3)"
               NOT ON SIZE ERROR
                   DISPLAY "TOTAL: " SMALL-TOTAL
           END-ADD

           COMPUTE AVERAGE-VAL ROUNDED = (AMOUNT-1 + AMOUNT-2) / DIVISOR
               ON SIZE ERROR
                   DISPLAY "OVERFLOW COMPUTING AVERAGE"
               NOT ON SIZE ERROR
                   DISPLAY "AVERAGE (ROUNDED): " AVERAGE-VAL
           END-COMPUTE
           STOP RUN.
